# Real-component CA carry-over placeholder.
#
# forge-notifier and other services that talk to Russian endpoints
# (api.giga.chat, ngw.devices.sberbank.ru) drop their .crt files here and
# the Dockerfile picks them up via `COPY build/ca/ /etc/pki/ca-trust/source/anchors/`
# + `update-ca-trust extract` in the final stage. The dummy doesn't talk
# to those endpoints, but the layout + Dockerfile step are in place so a
# real component can add certs without touching the build.
